# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.claude/

*.unitypackage

# Regression digests. Deliberately NOT committed: they describe the internals of paid
# avatars (layer, parameter and clip names) and this repo is public. They are local test
# data; losing them costs one re-run and an "accept current as baseline".
#
# Leading slash matters: an unanchored "Regression/" also swallows Dev/Corpus/, which
# is the harness itself and must be committed.
/Regression/


# Internal development notes; local only.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md

# Development spike and probes; local only.
/Dev/Spikes/

# Superseded local builds.
*.unitypackage.superseded-*
survey.md
pointers.md
slim.md
dead.md
strip.md
cloth.md

# Local agent tooling config, same class as CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md
.codex/

# Machine-specific paths for the dev scripts. Dev/local.cfg.example is the
# tracked template; the real one names this machine's directories.
/Dev/local.cfg

# Working notes between the agents on this repo. Local only: they name
# people and describe internal process, and this repo is public.
/Dev/dialogue.md
